#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0403 expect=noViolation domain=BW
#note "Written FIRST in runbook W2b (PLAN-operation-replacements §8), on the pre-change engine: a subject with no SJ stage in its phase. Subject 001 has one stage (earliest SJSTDTC 2020-01-01) and BWRPENDY 14 -> silent; subject 002 has no SJ record at all and a populated BWRPENDY (3). MEASURED on the pre-change engine: silent - the rule's Match_Datasets SJ join on (USUBJID, RPHASE) is the loader's default inner join, which drops the unmatched BW row before the Check runs, so the reference's no-group arm (EC-45: no group answers no value and a populated target fires) is NOT reachable through this rule; it is engine-tested (DateDiffDaysTest). This pin keeps the composed form from starting to report such a subject. One SJ stage: no join multiplication."
#library standard=sendig-dart version=1-2
dataset BW class=FINDINGS label="Body Weight"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col BWSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col RPHASE   type=Char label="Repro Phase"
col BWENDTC  type=Char label="End Date/Time of Observation"
col BWRPENDY type=Num  label="Repro Phase Day of End of Observation"
---
S1 | BW | 001 | 1 | P1 | 2020-01-15 | 14
S1 | BW | 002 | 1 | P1 | 2020-01-04 | 3
---

dataset SJ class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Subject Repro Stages"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SJSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col RPHASE  type=Char label="Repro Phase"
col RSTAGE  type=Char label="Repro Stage"
col SJSTDTC type=Char label="Start Date/Time of Repro Stage"
col SJENDTC type=Char label="End Date/Time of Repro Stage"
---
S1 | SJ | 001 | 1 | P1 | STAGE1 | 2020-01-01 | 2020-01-20
---
